The experimental B/W startup proposal (was pc/patch_bw_startup.py): five
reviewed call sites in sub_02011D9C, the game-system proc init. Each four-byte
Thumb BL becomes two two-byte instructions, so every later guest address and
the caller's literal pool stay put: omit this caller's overlay 230 load and
unload and its third call, return 0 from the first check and the complement
of r1 from the second. This substitutes the detectors' outcomes; it does not
implement overlay 230 (docs/BW_PLAN.md). SHA256SUMS pins the result to the
tracked snapshot of this file.

